{"c":[{"name":"20260912T165056Z-1e3c090a0fc2764f","text":"always-tdd in-scope is behavior a user of this product can observe breaking (no CLI/workflow category list). Preflight classifies and FAILs on that test, not the plan's executable label (#123).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T170355Z-1e7e525d29c37eed","text":"Niko workflow skills keep references/ beside SKILL.md under rulesets/niko/skills/; topic skills still live under rules/ and symlink into a ruleset.","type":"note"}]}
